            "user": "mappy123",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/mappy123",
            "action": "opened",
            "text": "I believe that only the road to the north is Rainwater Drive, the other two are Rainwater Boulevard. At least that is what road signs suggest. The strange part is that for example the Village Tavern has as address Rainwater Drive.",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">I believe that only the road to the north is Rainwater Drive, the other two are Rainwater Boulevard. At least that is what road signs suggest. The strange part is that for example the Village Tavern has as address Rainwater Drive.</p>"
